  "scope": "Nonlinear update admissibility/conservation; conservative-to-primitive derivative connection; frozen and spatially varying principal-update energy estimates; grid-independent 3D embedding; exact noncontraction witness; actual entropy derivatives, convexity, finite averaging bound and local Euler entropy balance. The variable-coefficient estimate assumes explicit state and spatial-difference bounds. Existence, nonlinear full-solve stability, continuum solver accuracy and matching work optimality remain unproved. Actual nonlinear finite-step entropy dissipation is checked under explicit convex-region, curvature, flux, viscosity and timestep conditions. Uniform trajectory membership and those conditions for the current numerical settings remain unproved."
